### ຕິດຕັ້ງ extension "REST Client" ໃນ VS Code ແລ້ວກົດ Send Request ທີລະ block ຈາກເທິງລົງລຸ່ມ
### ຕ້ອງມີ admin ກ່ອນ: npm run create-admin -- --email admin@example.com --password "Admin12345"
### (ມີ automated test ຄົບກວ່າແລ້ວ: npm test)

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api
@adminEmail = admin@example.com
@adminPassword = Admin12345
@stuEmail = stu-{{$timestamp}}@example.com

### 1) Admin login
# @name adminLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "{{adminEmail}}", "password": "{{adminPassword}}" }

###
@adminToken = {{adminLogin.response.body.accessToken}}

### 2) Dashboard
GET {{baseUrl}}/reports/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 3) ສ້າງຕຶກ
# @name building
POST {{baseUrl}}/buildings
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "ຕຶກ {{$timestamp}}", "address": "ວຽງຈັນ", "totalFloors": 4 }

###
@buildingId = {{building.response.body.data.id}}

### 4) ສ້າງຫ້ອງ
# @name room
POST {{baseUrl}}/rooms
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "roomNumber": "A{{$randomInt 100 999}}", "buildingId": {{buildingId}}, "capacity": 2, "price": 500000 }

###
@roomId = {{room.response.body.data.id}}

### 5) ນັກສຶກສາສະໝັກ (ລະບົບສ້າງຂໍ້ມູນນັກສຶກສາໃຫ້ອັດຕະໂນມັດ)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Test Student", "email": "{{stuEmail}}", "password": "pass1234" }

### 6) ນັກສຶກສາ login
# @name stuLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "{{stuEmail}}", "password": "pass1234" }

###
@stuToken = {{stuLogin.response.body.accessToken}}

### 7) ນັກສຶກສາຈອງຫ້ອງ (ສະຖານະ pending)
# @name booking
POST {{baseUrl}}/bookings
Authorization: Bearer {{stuToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "roomId": {{roomId}}, "checkInDate": "2026-10-01" }

###
@bookingId = {{booking.response.body.data.id}}

### 8) Admin ອະນຸມັດ
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/bookings/{{bookingId}}/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 9) ອອກບິນລາຍເດືອນ (ເບິ່ງຕົວຢ່າງ dryRun ກ່ອນ)
POST {{baseUrl}}/payments/generate-monthly
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "month": "2026-10", "dueDay": 5, "dryRun": true }

### 10) ອອກບິນຈິງ
POST {{baseUrl}}/payments/generate-monthly
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "month": "2026-10", "dueDay": 5 }

### 11) ນັກສຶກສາເບິ່ງບິນຂອງຕົນ
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{stuToken}}

### 12) ລາຍການຊຳລະທັງໝົດ (admin/staff)
# @name pays
GET {{baseUrl}}/payments?status=pending&limit=5
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

###
@paymentId = {{pays.response.body.data[0].id}}

### 13) ຮັບຊຳລະ → ໄດ້ເລກໃບຮັບເງິນ
PUT {{baseUrl}}/payments/{{paymentId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "paid", "method": "cash" }

### 14) ໃບຮັບເງິນ
GET {{baseUrl}}/payments/{{paymentId}}/receipt
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
